        "collapsible_tab_Va34xQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "show_description": false,
            "description_heading": "",
            "heading_1": "📏 Sizing Help – Find Your Perfect Fit",
            "content_1": "<p>👉 True-to-size fit — order your regular size with confidence!</p><p>👉 Made with <strong>Gildan 5000 Heavyweight 100% cotton tees</strong> — the industry standard and the absolute best canvas for vibrant tie-dye. If you’ve worn Gildan before, order the same size here.<br/><br/>👉 Full size range from S to 5XL — inclusivity is our vibe. Don't see this design in 5XL? <a href=\"https://shopfreespirited.com/collections/shop-sale?filter.v.price.gte=&filter.v.price.lte=&filter.v.option.size=4XL&filter.v.option.size=5XL&sort_by=best-selling\" title=\"https://shopfreespirited.com/collections/shop-sale?filter.v.price.gte=&filter.v.price.lte=&filter.v.option.size=4XL&filter.v.option.size=5XL&sort_by=best-selling\">Shop all of our 4XL and 5XL designs here.</a><br/><br/>👉 Unsure about your size? Our <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0624/1917/3575/files/swirl-blue-premium-hand-dyed-comfort-shirt-967010.png?v=1745861875\" title=\"Size Chart\"><strong>Size Chart</strong></a> shows exact measurements.<br/><br/>👉 Prefer extra room? Size up for an even more relaxed, flowy fit.<br/><br/>👉 Still not sure? We’re happy to help! <a href=\"https://shopfreespirited.com/pages/contact\" title=\"https://shopfreespirited.com/pages/contact\">Contact us</a> for personal sizing advice.</p>",
            "heading_2": "📦 Shipping Info – Fast from Florida 🇺🇸",
            "content_2": "<p>👉 We ship fast from our shop in Sunrise, Florida.<br/><br/>👉 Orders leave our warehouse in <strong>1–2 business days</strong>.<br/><br/>👉 You’ll receive a tracking number as soon as your order ships.<br/><br/>👉 Proudly based in the USA 🇺🇸 — no long overseas wait times!<br/><br/>👉 Free U.S. shipping on orders over $50.</p>",
            "heading_3": "🎨 Quality Guarantee — Made to Last",
            "content_3": "<p>👉 Each shirt is <strong>hand-dyed with love</strong> — no two are exactly the same<br/><br/>👉 Crafted from <strong>100% pre-shrunk cotton</strong> for buttery softness and long-lasting fit.<br/><br/>👉 <strong>Vibrant colors</strong> that stay bold and beautiful — even after 100+ washes!<br/><br/>👉 Designer-quality tie-dye without the designer price tag.<br/><br/>👉 Thousands of happy customers — read their real reviews below!</p><p>👉 Easy 30-day returns — shop with peace of mind.</p>",
            "heading_4": "",
            "content_4": ""
          }
        },
